@startuml get-manager-audit-log
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/audit-log
caption CRB-81 · 어드민 감사 로그 목록 (superadmin 전용, 읽기 전용). 수정 · 삭제 API는 없음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminAuditLogController" as Controller
participant "AdminAuditLogService" as Service
participant "AdminAuditLogRepository" as AuditRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/audit-log?admin_email&action&target_type&target_id&created_from&created_to&page&size\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (action · target_type은 정의된 값, target_id 길이, 날짜 형식, page · size 범위)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: list(query)
Controller -> Service: list(query)
alt created_from이 created_to보다 늦음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 created_from must not be after created_to
end
Service -> AuditRepository: findPage(filter, offset, limit)
par 동시에 조회 — 같은 조건
  AuditRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT admin_audit_log\nWHERE admin_email ILIKE ? AND action = ? AND target_type = ? AND target_id = ? AND created_at 범위\nORDER BY created_at DESC, pk DESC LIMIT OFFSET
  PostgreSQL --> AuditRepository: rows
else
  AuditRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 조건)
  PostgreSQL --> AuditRepository: total
end
AuditRepository --> Service: { rows, total }
note right of Service
  admin_email은 기록 시점 이메일이라 어드민 계정을 지워도 그대로 남음.
  before · after는 JSON 그대로 응답 (생성이면 before = null, 삭제면 after = null).
  이 조회 자체는 기록하지 않음
end note
Service --> Controller: PageResponseDto<AdminAuditLogDto>
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ pk, admin_email, action, target_type, target_id, before, after, created_at }], page, size, total }

@enduml
